title Cassette Bluetooth (T4, synthetic names): PLAY with the headset as output while it leaves its call profile: "Switching to music mode... 1 s" in the strip's time slot (landscape) or, the info box being too narrow for it, the notice place (portrait, square)
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO playing
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT switching
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
@480x320 expect text "PLAYING TAKE 006 · Switching to music mode... 1 s"
@640x480 expect text "PLAYING TAKE 006 · Switching to music mode... 1 s"
@800x480 expect text "PLAYING TAKE 006 · Switching to music mode... 1 s"
@320x480 expect text "Switching to music mode... 1 s"
@480x800 expect text "Switching to music mode... 1 s"
@480x480 expect text "Switching to music mode... 1 s"
@720x720 expect text "Switching to music mode... 1 s"
shot switching
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
